# Fixture registry: the same type classified twice. Last-wins would let the later line silently downgrade a
# person type to non-person, and every person-only rule skips non-person — so the shadowed line would take
# the erasure obligation with it.
FixtureResource => person :: src/Fixture/PhantomEraser.php :: features/witness-complete.feature
FixtureResource => non-person
